# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0156.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Feature PR opened -> Squash-merge to master: "CI: full run"
Squash-merge to master -> Versioning opens/updates Release PR: "CI: full run, live acceptance skipped if the PR already passed it on this exact tree"
Versioning opens/updates Release PR -> Maintainer merges Release PR: "CI: gate skips all test jobs"
Maintainer merges Release PR -> Versioning creates vX.Y.Z tag: "CI: gate skips all test jobs"
Versioning creates vX.Y.Z tag -> GoReleaser publishes signed binaries: Release workflow
GoReleaser publishes signed binaries -> Terraform Registry indexes the version
